WEBVTT

00:10:00.512 --> 00:10:01.805
Yeah?

00:10:01.847 --> 00:10:08.812
(Cheers and applause)

00:10:08.854 --> 00:10:11.565
There is teacher support,

00:10:11.607 --> 00:10:13.776
diverse interactions ...

00:10:15.069 --> 00:10:16.362
team-building

00:10:16.403 --> 00:10:20.866
and practical application of reading,
writing, math and science.

00:10:21.659 --> 00:10:25.329
An environment where real
learning is happening,

00:10:26.497 --> 00:10:30.334
and students are discovering
their own genius.